		<meta name="keywords" content="EU compliance API, Digital Product Passport API, DPP registry, battery passport, CBAM API, C2PA provenance API, EU AI Act Article 50, EUDR API, embedded emissions, content credentials, deforestation-free, developer-first API, Allan Ninal">
